        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/03ac715b808c533d4ff327340e25a0a8.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever wanted to parry—purely, endlessly, beautifully?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hajiki</i> is a minimalist samurai duel game built entirely around the art of the parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/2f4ed58f4d5f3c78eaa0f4051acd2f96.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/e166c5b98721fe48227bc8dd682d43c3.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply tilt your right stick or move your mouse to block incoming strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, but incredibly hard to master — a perfect test of timing and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful parry sharpens your senses, pulling you deeper into a meditative flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Japan’s warring states era, two warriors face each other in a life-or-death duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combos. No attacks. Only perfect defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/824bbc5e0c07da0c0e4cafe6883e97d7.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep parrying to earn titles of mastery — from “Expert” to “Demon” to “Shura.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the ultimate flow state?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Stick ……  Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱 Mouse ……  Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁O key / ⭘（PS） ……  Retry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Start Button …… Return to Title</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁 C key / □（PS） ……  Switch View Mode</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/03ac715b808c533d4ff327340e25a0a8.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever wanted to parry—purely, endlessly, beautifully?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hajiki</i> is a minimalist samurai duel game built entirely around the art of the parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/2f4ed58f4d5f3c78eaa0f4051acd2f96.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/e166c5b98721fe48227bc8dd682d43c3.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply tilt your right stick or move your mouse to block incoming strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, but incredibly hard to master — a perfect test of timing and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful parry sharpens your senses, pulling you deeper into a meditative flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Japan’s warring states era, two warriors face each other in a life-or-death duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combos. No attacks. Only perfect defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084550/extras/824bbc5e0c07da0c0e4cafe6883e97d7.avif?t=1761637982\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep parrying to earn titles of mastery — from “Expert” to “Demon” to “Shura.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the ultimate flow state?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹 Stick ……  Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱 Mouse ……  Parry Input (Up / Down / Left / Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁O key / ⭘（PS） ……  Retry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Start Button …… Return to Title</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁 C key / □（PS） ……  Switch View Mode</p>",
